----------------------------
Yukyeong Lee, Yumin Choi, Jinheon Baek and Sung Ju Hwang.
"Don't Just Trust Your Memory: Evidence-Linked Memory Reduces Memory-Induced
Degradation in LLM Agents". arXiv:2611.14320, v1, submitted 10 Nov 2026.
