Upstream code (method only, not used)
-------------------------------------
WikiTrace, https://github.com/yukyeongleee/wikitrace
Pin: 9ee357fbb95db9caae09808f3472a9fce6409c90. Licence: Apache License 2.0.
The repository was not cloned, installed, imported or run, and no file,
function or text from it is copied here. Its README at the pin asks for
Docker, Node, uv and an OpenRouter API key, which this repository does not
use. Status: UNVERIFIED.

Method only: the idea of linking each insight to a summary of its run and to
the run's trajectory, and of descending through those links before acting on
an insight that lacks a detail, conflicts with another, or came from a failed
run. The paper's and README's own figures are recorded only as tokens with
offsets in paper_evidence.json and are marked UNVERIFIED.
